The bug was caused by the return type of the variable `ret` in the `file_seek` function being incorrectly defined as `int` instead of `off_t`. This mismatch could lead to incorrect handling of file offsets, potentially resulting in errors when seeking within files, especially for large files where offsets exceed the range of an `int`.

